{"availability":"available","full":"simplethemes/skeleton_wp","name":"skeleton_wp","description":"Skeleton is a simple, responsive WordPress theme based on the Skeleton Boilerplate. It has several useful shortcodes, such as tabs, toggles, cross-browser CSS3 buttons, and layout columns. It also includes a bbPress skin/stylesheet and sample child theme.","category":"Design","language":"PHP","stars":1000,"forks":375,"created":"2011-08-13T00:17:46Z","updated":"2017-08-02T12:08:26Z","branch":"master","homepage":"http://themes.simplethemes.com/skeleton/","topics":[],"demo":"http://demos.simplethemes.com/skeleton/documentation","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T14:57:11.557Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T14:57:11.557Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T14:57:11.557Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:31.905Z","stars":1001,"forks":375},{"at":"2026-10-07T23:29:59.411Z","stars":1001,"forks":375},{"at":"2026-10-10T01:08:13.220Z","stars":1001,"forks":375},{"at":"2026-10-15T14:57:11.557Z","stars":1000,"forks":375}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["For new installations, you may wish to install the latest stable version from wordpress.org.","Notice: Before updating Skeleton, please see the notes below as there are three branches to consider.","Why? As of version 2.1.x, the options formerly located within the Options Framework (under Appearance &rarr; Theme Options) have been moved to the native WP theme customizer to allow for acceptance into the WP.org theme repository. If you'd prefer to continue using the Options framework, please switch to the the 2.x-options-framework branch. See additional notes regarding shortcodes below."],"features":["For latest development version, please use the master branch.","If you're updating from Skeleton 1.x, please update from the 1.x branch.","If you're updating from Skeleton 2.0.x, please update from the 2.x-options-framework branch."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/simplethemes